{
  "name": "03 \u00b7 Webhook to Slack (LLM)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 \u00b7 Webhook \u2192 Slack\n\n**Clearest demo path (~5 min)**\n1. **Import** `workflows/03-webhook-to-slack.json`\n2. Create/select credentials:\n   - OpenAI account \u2192 node *LLM Format Slack Message*\n   - Slack API \u2192 node *Post to Slack*\n3. Open *Post to Slack* \u2192 pick channel (or set Channel ID)\n4. **Listen for test event** on webhook, or Activate\n5. POST:\n```bash\ncurl -X POST '<WEBHOOK_URL>' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"event\":\"deploy\",\"status\":\"success\",\"service\":\"billing-api\",\"detail\":\"v1.4.2 live\"}'\n```\n6. Check Slack + HTTP response\n\nNo secrets in this repo \u2014 see `CREDENTIALS.example.md`.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "21cc19f9-55bc-4d2a-b793-2126e59ccf75",
      "name": "Note \u2014 Setup Path",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "notify-slack",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "73d46868-520e-4a5e-b2f4-cfe2b372a63a",
      "name": "Event Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "325731dc-ee8c-498a-8361-35a93c53cde4",
      "notes": "Production URL appears after Activate. Use Test URL while building.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d7722c7d-c595-4fd7-b09f-3f87310cb55f",
              "name": "payload",
              "value": "={{ $json.body || $json }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "523afea1-130a-4574-b845-7660d3c5147e",
      "name": "Capture Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You format operational events for Slack. Return ONLY JSON: {\"text\": \"short fallback text\", \"blocks_md\": \"markdown message with emoji, bold service name, status, and one-line detail\"}. Keep under 500 chars. No secrets."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "=Format this event as a Slack message:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.payload) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": true,
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 350
        }
      },
      "id": "a7306ec3-9bd7-401b-8421-1f48c6995ce0",
      "name": "LLM Format Slack Message",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Map this to your OpenAI (or OpenAI-compatible) credential after import.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.blocks_md || $json.text || $json.message?.content || 'n8n event notification' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "28ad6d5e-307b-41f6-9f05-fbfada32a87f",
      "name": "Post to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_SLACK_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Replace Channel ID (e.g. C0123456789). Bot needs chat:write. Map Slack credential after import.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, posted: true, preview: $('LLM Format Slack Message').item.json } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5be6d333-c1c3-4076-bf56-881dbd598bf8",
      "name": "Respond OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
